WEBVTT

00:00.150 --> 00:01.759
Apophis.

00:02.459 --> 00:06.149
This rock is about three hundred and forty metres across.

00:06.599 --> 00:18.628
In April 2029, on Friday the thirteenth, it will pass about thirty-two thousand kilometres above the ground, closer than the satellites that carry television.

00:19.078 --> 00:20.342
It will miss.

00:20.792 --> 00:24.947
Here it is where it is today; this map cannot fly that pass.
